西攻武關、峣關，取之。前攻秦軍藍田南，又夜擊其北，秦軍大破，遂至咸陽，滅秦。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m003-0071"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji054-068:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p003","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"司馬","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m003-0071","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"單指未名官稱保留原用語，不補授任年或由被虜推死亡；候原字不擅改侯或指定爵位等級。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p003","text":"其後從攻東郡尉軍，破之成武南。擊王離軍成陽南，復攻之杠裏，大破之。追北，西至開封，擊趙賁軍，破之，圍趙賁開封城中。西擊將楊熊軍於曲遇，破之，虜秦司馬及御史各一人。遷為執珪。從攻陽武，下軒轅、緱氏，絕河津，還擊趙賁軍尸北，破之。從南攻犨，與南陽守齮戰陽城郭東，陷陳，取宛，虜齮，盡定南陽郡。從西攻武關、峣關，取之。前攻秦軍藍田南，又夜擊其北，秦軍大破，遂至咸陽，滅秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m003-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"913_1wz_ofu","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"其後從攻承接前段曹參軍事行程與爵秩敘事；同段遷為執珪的隱含受授者據此暫接曹參，非最近人名楊熊或南陽守齮。"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m003-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"東郡尉","kind":"person","person_id":"tup_86k_24c","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"依本段單指官員、各一人或後相對話辨認；未名不補姓名，不與同官稱者全域合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m003-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"d0z_er0_gco","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m003-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"趙賁","kind":"person","person_id":"bwv_p3h_q1j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m003-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"趙賁","kind":"person","person_id":"bwv_p3h_q1j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m003-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"楊熊","kind":"person","person_id":"3ja_mh8_wrw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"i